  descripcion_larga_en = $d$The KP 5" wheel walker in anodized aluminum is the perfect choice for those seeking a mobility device that combines lightness, durability and functionality. The material of its structure guarantees a long service life, while the 5" solid wheels with star rim ensure smooth movement on any surface. Adjustable in height, this walker adapts to each user's needs, providing comfortable and personalized support.

