  descripcion_larga_en = $d$The wheeled walker KP1-8437 is designed to provide safe and reliable support to users requiring mobility assistance in a variety of environments, both indoors and outdoors. Made of resistant steel, this rollator combines durability with comfort, thanks to its wider 35 cm seat with bar-style backrest and its storage bag under the seat.

The Konfort Plus steel rollator (grey) is a four-wheeled walker with a seat, featuring an under-seat bag, adjustable handle height, bar-type backrest and dual-function brake operated from the handles. It is ideal to support mobility of users who need walking assistance, especially indoors, with a capacity of 100 kg.$d$,
