El rollator en acero Konfort Plus KP1-8440 (gris) tiene cuatro ruedas de PU con rin estrella, asiento de PVC acolchado, 5 puntos de graduación de altura de la empuñadura y capacidad de 100 kg. Está diseñado para apoyar la marcha con descanso incorporado.$d$,
  descripcion_larga_en = $d$The wheeled walker KP1-8440-I is designed to provide robust and reliable support to users requiring mobility assistance, especially outdoors. Made of resistant steel, this rollator combines durability with comfort thanks to its seat with bar-style backrest and its storage basket under the seat.

The Konfort Plus KP1-8440 steel rollator (grey) has four star-rim PU wheels, a padded PVC seat, 5 handle height adjustment points and a 100 kg capacity. It is designed to support walking with built-in rest.$d$,
